<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>ZenRay Website, Capsules HDA et Design Craft</title>
<!--
  DIRECTION 05, CAPSULES DEPLIABLES HDA.
  Trois propositions de design craft pour les capsules Bio :
  1. Pure Pill Liquid Glass : silhouette capsule epuree avec morphing doux vers carte arrondie.
  2. Monogram Split Pill : badge d'ancrage compact a gauche, pastille tactile a droite.
  3. Editorial Glow et Stepper : lueur corail chaude, typographie serif fine, numerotation 01 02 03.

  Fonctionnalites integrees :
  - Sliders CSS branchés sur :root (rayon 999px ferme, rayon ouvert, paddings, opacites, flou, tailles).
  - Mode edition de texte direct (contenteditable) avec export JSON dans le presse-papier.
  - Bascule trilingue instantanee : Francais, English, 日本語.
  - Bascule theme clair et sombre.
-->
<style>
  @font-face{font-family:'Inter';src:url('fonts/InterVariable.woff2') format('woff2');font-weight:100 900;font-style:normal;font-display:swap;}
  @font-face{font-family:'AnthropicSerif';src:url('fonts/AnthropicSerif-Romans.woff2') format('woff2');font-weight:300 800;font-style:normal;font-display:swap;}
  @font-face{font-family:'AnthropicSerif';src:url('fonts/AnthropicSerif-Italics.woff2') format('woff2');font-weight:300 800;font-style:italic;font-display:swap;}

  :root {
    --sans: 'Inter', 'Inter Variable', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
    --serif: 'AnthropicSerif', Georgia, serif;
    --poids-sans: 400;
    --poids-serif: 350;

    /* Jetons de theme (Clair par defaut) */
    --fond: #EDEDEB;
    --fond-subtil: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.025);
    --surface: #FDFDFC;
    --encre: #1F1F1E;
    --encre-2: #6B6B68;
    --encre-3: #94928D;
    --filet: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.09);
    --accent: #A8552F;
    --accent-doux: rgba(168, 85, 47, 0.12);
    --accent-lueur: rgba(168, 85, 47, 0.22);
    --badge-bg: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);

    /* Jetons pilotés par les Sliders HDA */
    --capsule-r-closed: 999px;
    --capsule-r-open: 20px;
    --capsule-pad-y: 12px;
    --capsule-pad-x: 20px;
    --capsule-title-size: 15.5px;
    --capsule-body-size: 14.5px;
    --capsule-bg-alpha: 0.04;
    --capsule-border-alpha: 0.12;
    --capsule-blur: 16px;
    --points-gap: 10px;
    --expand-duree: 0.38s;
    --doux: cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);
  }

  .sombre {
    --fond: #141413;
    --fond-subtil: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    --surface: #1E1E1C;
    --encre: #F0EFEB;
    --encre-2: #A3A19A;
    --encre-3: #6E6C66;
    --filet: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    --accent: #E08356;
    --accent-doux: rgba(224, 131, 86, 0.16);
    --accent-lueur: rgba(224, 131, 86, 0.30);
    --badge-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; min-height: 100vh; }
  body {
    background: var(--fond);
    color: var(--encre);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: var(--poids-sans);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    transition: background 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease;
  }

  /* Entete de navigation de l'atelier */
  header.atelier-bar {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--filet);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  }
  .atelier-titres { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; }
  .atelier-titres h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 350; font-size: 20px; margin: 0; }
  .atelier-titres span { font-size: 13px; color: var(--encre-2); }

  .atelier-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .btn-groupe { display: inline-flex; border: 1px solid var(--filet); border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px; background: var(--fond-subtil); }
  .btn-opt {
    border: none; background: transparent; padding: 6px 14px;
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 13px; color: var(--encre-2);
    border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn-opt.actif { background: var(--surface); color: var(--encre); font-weight: 500; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
  .btn-tool {
    border: 1px solid var(--filet); background: var(--surface); padding: 7px 16px;
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 13px; color: var(--encre);
    border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  }
  .btn-tool:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .btn-tool.mode-on { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border-color: var(--accent); }

  /* Disposition principale */
  .layout { display: flex; min-height: calc(100vh - 61px); }
  main.contenu { flex: 1; padding: 48px 40px 100px; max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .chapo-section { margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .chapo-section h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 350; font-size: 32px; margin: 0 0 8px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .chapo-section p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--encre-2); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; max-width: 68ch; }

  /* Bloc proposition */
  .proposition-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--filet);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 32px 36px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
  }
  .prop-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 24px; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--filet); }
  .prop-header h3 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 350; font-size: 22px; margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .prop-tag { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-doux); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .prop-desc { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--encre-2); }

  .prop-demo-zone { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }

  /* =========================================================
     COMPOSANTS CAPSULES (3 PROPOSITIONS)
     ========================================================= */

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     PROPOSITION 1 : PURE PILL LIQUID GLASS
     --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .capsule-p1 {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--capsule-r-closed);
    background: rgba(125, 125, 125, var(--capsule-bg-alpha));
    border: 1px solid rgba(125, 125, 125, var(--capsule-border-alpha));
    backdrop-filter: blur(var(--capsule-blur));
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(var(--capsule-blur));
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-radius var(--expand-duree) var(--doux), background 0.24s ease, border-color 0.24s ease, box-shadow 0.24s ease;
  }
  .capsule-p1:hover {
    border-color: rgba(125, 125, 125, calc(var(--capsule-border-alpha) + 0.12));
  }
  .capsule-p1.est-ouvert {
    border-radius: var(--capsule-r-open);
    background: rgba(125, 125, 125, calc(var(--capsule-bg-alpha) + 0.02));
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .capsule-btn-trigger {
    width: 100%;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    padding: var(--capsule-pad-y) var(--capsule-pad-x);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .capsule-btn-trigger:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }

  .capsule-p1-text {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: var(--capsule-title-size);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--encre);
    margin: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .capsule-p1-toggle {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--encre-2);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .capsule-dots { letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.6; }
  .capsule-icon-arrow {
    width: 14px; height: 14px;
    transition: transform var(--expand-duree) var(--doux);
  }
  .est-ouvert .capsule-icon-arrow { transform: rotate(180deg); }

  .capsule-expand-content {
    max-height: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height var(--expand-duree) var(--doux), opacity 0.28s ease;
  }
  .est-ouvert .capsule-expand-content {
    max-height: 800px;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .capsule-inner-padding {
    padding: 6px var(--capsule-pad-x) calc(var(--capsule-pad-y) + 8px);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(125, 125, 125, calc(var(--capsule-border-alpha) * 0.6));
  }
  .capsule-full-body {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: var(--capsule-body-size);
    line-height: 1.68;
    color: var(--encre);
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    opacity: 0.92;
  }
  .capsule-points-list {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--points-gap);
  }
  .capsule-point-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: var(--capsule-body-size);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--encre);
  }
  .capsule-point-num {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     PROPOSITION 2 : MONOGRAM SPLIT PILL
     --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .capsule-p2 {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--capsule-r-closed);
    background: rgba(125, 125, 125, var(--capsule-bg-alpha));
    border: 1px solid rgba(125, 125, 125, var(--capsule-border-alpha));
    backdrop-filter: blur(var(--capsule-blur));
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(var(--capsule-blur));
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-radius var(--expand-duree) var(--doux), background 0.24s ease, border-color 0.24s ease;
  }
  .capsule-p2:hover { border-color: rgba(125, 125, 125, calc(var(--capsule-border-alpha) + 0.14)); }
  .capsule-p2.est-ouvert {
    border-radius: var(--capsule-r-open);
    background: var(--surface);
    border-color: var(--filet);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }
  .capsule-badge-pill {
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--badge-bg);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--encre);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .capsule-p2 .capsule-btn-trigger { padding: var(--capsule-pad-y) calc(var(--capsule-pad-x) - 4px); }
  .capsule-round-toggle {
    width: 28px; height: 28px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--badge-bg);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, transform var(--expand-duree) var(--doux);
  }
  .capsule-p2:hover .capsule-round-toggle { background: var(--accent-doux); color: var(--accent); }
  .capsule-p2.est-ouvert .capsule-round-toggle { transform: rotate(180deg); background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     PROPOSITION 3 : EDITORIAL GLOW ET STEPPER
     --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .capsule-p3 {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--capsule-r-closed);
    background: rgba(125, 125, 125, var(--capsule-bg-alpha));
    border: 1px solid rgba(125, 125, 125, var(--capsule-border-alpha));
    backdrop-filter: blur(var(--capsule-blur));
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(var(--capsule-blur));
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    transition: border-radius var(--expand-duree) var(--doux), border-color 0.24s ease, box-shadow 0.24s ease;
  }
  .capsule-p3::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: inherit; pointer-events: none;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 16px var(--accent-lueur); opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }
  .capsule-p3:hover::before { opacity: 0.4; }
  .capsule-p3.est-ouvert {
    border-radius: var(--capsule-r-open);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px var(--accent-doux);
  }
  .capsule-p3.est-ouvert::before { opacity: 0.2; }
  .capsule-chip-dots {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--badge-bg);
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--encre-2);
  }
  .capsule-p3 .capsule-point-num {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--accent);
    padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--accent-doux);
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     PROPOSITION 4 : ALL-IN-ONE CAPSULE (Tag + Dots + Flèche)
     --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .capsule-p4 {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--capsule-r-closed);
    background: rgba(125, 125, 125, var(--capsule-bg-alpha));
    border: 1px solid rgba(125, 125, 125, var(--capsule-border-alpha));
    backdrop-filter: blur(var(--capsule-blur));
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(var(--capsule-blur));
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    /* Easing 1 avec bordure attenuee */
    transition: border-radius var(--expand-duree) var(--doux),
                background 0.28s var(--doux),
                border-color 0.28s var(--doux),
                box-shadow 0.28s var(--doux);
  }
  .capsule-p4:hover {
    border-color: rgba(125, 125, 125, calc(var(--capsule-border-alpha) + 0.08));
  }
  
  /* Mode Option A : Atténuation douce */
  .capsule-p4.est-ouvert {
    border-radius: var(--capsule-r-open);
    background: rgba(125, 125, 125, calc(var(--capsule-bg-alpha) + 0.025));
    border-color: rgba(125, 125, 125, calc(var(--capsule-border-alpha) + 0.04));
    box-shadow: 0 8px 26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  /* Mode Option B : Fade in Noir/Blanc selon thème */
  .capsule-p4.mode-fade-theme {
    border-color: rgba(125, 125, 125, calc(var(--capsule-border-alpha) * 0.5));
  }
  .capsule-p4.mode-fade-theme::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: inherit; pointer-events: none;
    background: var(--surface); opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--expand-duree) var(--doux);
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .capsule-p4.mode-fade-theme.est-ouvert::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .capsule-p4.mode-fade-theme.est-ouvert {
    border-radius: var(--capsule-r-open);
    border-color: var(--filet);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }
  .capsule-p4 > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  /* Éléments internes Proposition 4 */
  .capsule-p4 .capsule-btn-trigger {
    padding: var(--capsule-pad-y) var(--capsule-pad-x);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;
  }
  .capsule-dots-pill {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--badge-bg); font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--encre-2);
    flex-shrink: 0; transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .capsule-p4:hover .capsule-dots-pill {
    background: var(--accent-doux); color: var(--accent);
  }
  .capsule-p4 .capsule-round-toggle {
    width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--badge-bg); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0; transition: background 0.2s ease, transform var(--expand-duree) var(--doux);
  }
  .capsule-p4:hover .capsule-round-toggle { background: var(--accent-doux); color: var(--accent); }
  .capsule-p4.est-ouvert .capsule-round-toggle { transform: rotate(180deg); background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }

  /* Toggles options pour masquer les éléments */
  .hide-tag .opt-tag { display: none !important; }
  .hide-dots .opt-dots { display: none !important; }
  .hide-arrow .opt-arrow { display: none !important; }

  /* Mode edition de texte */
  [contenteditable="true"] {
    outline: 1px dashed var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 3px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(168, 85, 47, 0.05);
  }
  [contenteditable="true"]:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    background: rgba(168, 85, 47, 0.09);
  }

  /* =========================================================
     PANNEAU DE SLIDERS HDA (ASIDE)
     ========================================================= */
  aside.design-sliders {
    width: 320px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--filet);
    padding: 24px 20px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: -4px 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
  }
  .sliders-title {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 350; font-size: 19px;
    margin: 0 0 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .sliders-sub { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--encre-2); margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .slider-row { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .slider-label {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--encre); margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .slider-val {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500;
  }
  .slider-input {
    width: 100%; height: 5px; -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none;
    background: var(--filet); border-radius: 999px; outline: none;
  }
  .slider-input::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none; width: 15px; height: 15px;
    border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }
  .slider-input::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover { transform: scale(1.2); }

  .btn-copier-prompt {
    width: 100%; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 999px; border: none;
    background: var(--accent); color: #fff; font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .btn-copier-prompt:hover { opacity: 0.9; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .copie-feedback {
    font-size: 12px; color: var(--accent); text-align: center;
    margin-top: 8px; min-height: 16px; font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="atelier-bar">
  <div class="atelier-titres">
    <h1>ZenRay Capsules</h1>
    <span>Atelier Design Craft HDA</span>
  </div>

  <div class="atelier-actions">
    <div class="btn-groupe" role="group" aria-label="Choix de langue">
      <button type="button" class="btn-opt actif" onclick="changerLangue('fr', this)">Français</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn-opt" onclick="changerLangue('en', this)">English</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn-opt" onclick="changerLangue('ja', this)">日本語</button>
    </div>

    <button type="button" class="btn-tool" onclick="toggleTout()">
      <span id="btn-tout-label">Tout Déplier</span>
    </button>

    <button type="button" class="btn-tool" id="btn-theme" onclick="toggleTheme()">
      <span id="theme-label">Mode Sombre</span>
    </button>

    <button type="button" class="btn-tool" id="btn-edit-text" onclick="toggleTextEdit()">
      <span>Mode Édition Texte</span>
    </button>

    <button type="button" class="btn-tool" onclick="copierTextesEdites()">
      <span>Copier Textes</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="layout">
  <main class="contenu">

    <div class="chapo-section">
      <h2>Capsules dépliables, 4 propositions</h2>
      <p>Bord arrondi 999px à l'état fermé, petits points « ... » et flèche toggle. Ajuste les sliders à droite pour trouver les valeurs idéales, édite les textes directement en un clic, puis valide la proposition retenue pour le déploiement.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- PROPOSITION 1 -->
    <section class="proposition-card">
      <div class="prop-header">
        <div>
          <h3>Proposition 1 <span class="prop-tag">Pure Pill Liquid Glass</span></h3>
          <span class="prop-desc">Silhouette capsule épurée, morphing organique vers carte douce.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prop-demo-zone">
        <!-- Capsule AI (Prop 1) -->
        <div class="capsule-p1" id="p1-ai">
          <button type="button" class="capsule-btn-trigger" onclick="toggleCapsule('p1-ai')">
            <p class="capsule-p1-text data-ai-short">Mon point sur l'IA : elle ne doit pas servir d'outil artistique...</p>
            <div class="capsule-p1-toggle">
              <span class="capsule-dots">...</span>
              <svg class="capsule-icon-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </button>
          <div class="capsule-expand-content">
            <div class="capsule-inner-padding">
              <div class="capsule-full-body data-ai-long"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
